{
  "name": "EU VAT (VIES) & Company KYB Enricher (Google Sheets + ClearStack Data Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EU VAT (VIES) & Official Registry KYB Enricher\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Connect your Google Sheet containing a `vat_or_id` column (EU VAT, FR SIREN/SIRET, CH UID, NO Org.nr, FI Business ID, LEI, or company name).\n2. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n3. Run manually or attach a Schedule/Webhook trigger.\n\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/eu-company-kyb-enricher",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "setup-sticky-note",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Companies"
        }
      },
      "id": "read-sheet",
      "name": "Read VAT / Company IDs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const queries = items.map(i => i.json.vat_or_id || i.json.query).filter(Boolean);\nreturn [{ json: { queries, validateVat: true, enrichGleifLei: true, concurrency: 3 } }];"
      },
      "id": "batch-queries",
      "name": "Batch Identifiers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~eu-company-kyb-enricher/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "call-apify-kyb",
      "name": "Run ClearStack EU KYB & VIES Enricher",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Enriched_KYB"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        }
      },
      "id": "write-sheet",
      "name": "Write Verified KYB Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1140,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read VAT / Company IDs",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read VAT / Company IDs": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Batch Identifiers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Batch Identifiers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run ClearStack EU KYB & VIES Enricher",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run ClearStack EU KYB & VIES Enricher": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write Verified KYB Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
